{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAMJ.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"commission-ohlo","title":"Fetch Ohlo's potion - turned in","detail":"Ohlo drank his potion and settled the reward.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"ohlo-rope-guild-entry","title":"The Rope Guild entrance","detail":"The party found the notice just north of the entrance to the Old Rope Guild."},{"id":"ohlo-rope-guild","title":"The Old Rope Guild","detail":"The party entered the former Rope Guild in the Slums."},{"id":"ohlo-booth","title":"The Rope Guild booth","detail":"The man in the booth says he has nothing to sell."},{"id":"ohlo-package-received","title":"The Rope Guild package","detail":"The booth merchant gave the party a package after hearing Ohlo's name. Bring it back to Ohlo."},{"id":"ohlo-delivered","title":"Ohlo drank the potion","detail":"Ohlo drank the potion, grew younger, and offered the promised reward."},{"id":"passage-sokal","title":"Passage to Sokal Keep","detail":"The harbor master says you can reach the keep by boat."},{"id":"sokal-arrival","title":"Arrival at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party landed on Thorn Island."},{"id":"commission-slums","title":"Clear the Slums - in progress","detail":"Keep clearing encounters in the Slums until the district is secure. 4 of 25 encounters cleared.","status":"accepted","clearedEncounters":4},{"id":"commission-sokal","title":"Clear Sokal Keep - offered","detail":"Find passage to Thorn Island, clear the keep, and report to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-records","title":"Recover records of old Phlan - offered","detail":"Search the old city for historical records and bring worthwhile finds to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"sokal-reeds","title":"Reeds by the keep gate","detail":"The party saw a mound of reeds west of the gates."},{"id":"sokal-parchment","title":"The parchment at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party found a damaged scroll on a dead elf outside the keep."},{"id":"sokal-patrol-passed","title":"Sokal Keep patrol","detail":"The undead patrol accepted the word and let the party pass."},{"id":"sokal-old-armory","title":"The old armory","detail":"The weapons and armor in the old armory have decayed."},{"id":"sokal-hidden-armory","title":"The hidden armory","detail":"The party passed through a wall in the northeastern armory and saw a glow in the northwest corner."},{"id":"sokal-armory-stands","title":"Equipment in the hidden armory","detail":"The party found weapon and armor stands at the source of the glow."},{"id":"sokal-armory-opened","title":"Hidden armory treasure opened","detail":"The party opened the equipment cache in the hidden armory."},{"id":"sokal-haunt-floorboard","title":"A diary beneath the floorboard","detail":"A spirit pointed out the floorboard where the old defenders left their account."},{"id":"sokal-haunt-diary","title":"The defenders' diary","detail":"The party copied the recovered diary pages as journal entry 3 and found gems under the floorboard."},{"id":"journal-entry-3","title":"Journal entry 3","detail":"The party encountered a reference to entry 3 in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"phlan-temple-healing","title":"Healing at the Temple of Tyr","detail":"The priests at the Temple of Tyr in New Phlan offer healing."},{"id":"sokal-return-pier","title":"Boat back from Thorn Island","detail":"The party found a boat returning to New Phlan at the south pier."},{"id":"phlan-training-directions","title":"Training school directions","detail":"From the notices, go north to train magic users or clerics. Go east to train fighters or rogues."},{"id":"phlan-training-fighters","title":"Fighter training door","detail":"Go east past the arena in New Phlan, then take the north door marked Fighters. Accept the trainer's offer and select Train Character."},{"id":"phlan-sune-healing","title":"Healing at the Temple of Sune","detail":"Priestess Joy of Sune offers healing in New Phlan."},{"id":"phlan-arena-recruits","title":"Adventuring partners in New Phlan","detail":"The arena master can introduce adventurers who take a share of the party's treasure."},{"id":"phlan-training-thieves","title":"Thief training door","detail":"Go east past the arena to the north door marked Rogues, next to the fighter school. Accept the trainer's offer, select the thief, then choose Train Character."}],"tracked":"commission-sokal","party":{"SAVE\\CHRDATJ1.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ1.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ1.SPC":"WgAA/wANAI86YQAA/wAGAJA6GgAA/wAPAJA6LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATJ2.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ2.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ2.SPC":"WgAA/wAJALc6YQAA/wACALg6GgAA/wALALg6LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATJ3.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ3.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ3.SPC":"WgAA/wAGANs6YQAA/wAPANs6GgAA/wAIANw6LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATJ4.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ4.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ4.SPC":"WgAA/wABAAc7YQAA/wAKAAc7GgAA/wADAAg7LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATJ5.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ5.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATJ5.SPC":"WgAA/wALADY